OL,3,GNEWSASchool's Golden Jubilee to be
OL,4,Amarked with events
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff, pupils and alumni are set to
OL,7,Fcelebrate a school's 50th anniversary
OL,8,Fwith a range of events.
OL,10,FLa Houguette Primary School opened on
OL,11,F19 November 1976 to serve St Pierre du
OL,12,FBois, St Saviour and Torteval.
OL,14,FHeadteacher Claire Judd described the
OL,15,FGolden Jubilee year as "an
OL,16,Fextraordinarily proud moment for
OL,17,Feveryone" connected with the school.
